            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "C Man"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thanks for the clear instructions. Just made bok choy for the first time and it was delicious!\n\nI like to follow recipes like this by taste so I put loads of added olive oil as it fried with fresh garlic. I also mixed in my favorite steak seasoning (I like it on everything fried haha sodium free) which added really good flavor with a little bit of salt. I also used a lid so it was steaming at the same time, I find it cooks better like that sometimes.\n\nDefinitely going to be making this again!",
            "datePublished": "2015-08-08T07:35:48.907Z"
          },
